{"id":"level-up-2026-10-11","name":"2026-10-11 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1151","en":"We watched a horror film set in an abandoned hotel.","zh":"我们看了一部以废弃旅馆为背景的恐怖片。","note":"horror · 害怕， 恐怖 · a horror film","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1152","en":"The detective found a bottle labelled poison in the fictional laboratory.","zh":"侦探在故事中的实验室里发现了一个标有“毒药”的瓶子。","note":"poison · 毒，毒药；毒害 · a bottle of poison","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1153","en":"The child's peaceful slumber continued despite the rain outside.","zh":"尽管外面下着雨，孩子仍安然熟睡。","note":"slumber · 睡眠，安睡 · peaceful slumber","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1154","en":"The teacher sought to inculcate a habit of checking evidence.","zh":"老师努力培养学生核查证据的习惯。","note":"inculcate · 谆谆教诲， 反复灌输 · inculcate a habit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1155","en":"The experiment tested different conditions to find the optimum temperature.","zh":"实验测试了不同条件，以找出最佳温度。","note":"optimum · 最好的； 最有利的 · optimum conditions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1156","en":"We managed to persuade our neighbour to join the choir.","zh":"我们成功说服邻居加入合唱团。","note":"persuade · 说服， 劝说； 使相信 · persuade someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1157","en":"The committee reached a consensus after discussing three possible designs.","zh":"讨论了三种可选设计后，委员会达成了共识。","note":"consensus · 共识； 一致 · reach a consensus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1158","en":"The identical corridors can disorientate visitors entering the building.","zh":"一模一样的走廊可能让进入大楼的访客迷失方向。","note":"disorientate · 使失去方向感； 使迷茫， 使不知所措 · disorientate visitors","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1159","en":"The researchers compared tropospheric temperatures recorded at different altitudes.","zh":"研究人员比较了不同海拔记录的对流层温度。","note":"tropospheric · 对流层的 · tropospheric temperatures","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1160","en":"The audience waited in absolute silence for the performance to begin.","zh":"观众在完全安静中等待演出开始。","note":"absolute · 完全的， 绝对的， 纯粹的 · absolute silence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1161","en":"The guide will describe how the old printing press works.","zh":"导游将描述这台旧印刷机如何工作。","note":"describe · 描述， 描写， 形容 · describe a process","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1162","en":"I had just enough time to grab my bag.","zh":"我只有刚好够拿起包的时间。","note":"grab · 抓， 夺 · grab a bag","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1163","en":"The novel describes daily life in a crowded urban slum.","zh":"小说描写了一处拥挤的城市贫民区的日常生活。","note":"slum · 贫民窟， 贫民区 · a crowded slum","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1164","en":"A wealthy donor helped fund the restoration of the theatre.","zh":"一位富裕的捐赠者帮助资助了剧院修复。","note":"wealthy · 富的， 富裕的； 充裕的 · a wealthy donor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1165","en":"A layer of foam formed on the rushing water.","zh":"湍急的水面上形成了一层泡沫。","note":"foam · 起泡沫；泡沫；泡沫材料 · a layer of foam","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1166","en":"The river remains navigable for small boats during summer.","zh":"这条河在夏季仍可供小船通航。","note":"navigable · 可通航的； 适于航行的 · a navigable river","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1167","en":"She works in administration at the local music college.","zh":"她在当地音乐学院从事行政工作。","note":"administration · 管理； 行政 · school administration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1168","en":"The story describes creatures that dwell beneath the forest floor.","zh":"故事描写了栖居在森林地表之下的生物。","note":"dwell · 居住， 栖身 · dwell in","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1169","en":"The revised plan will incorporate feedback from local residents.","zh":"修订后的计划将纳入当地居民的反馈。","note":"incorporate · 把…合并， 纳入； 包含， 吸收 · incorporate feedback","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1170","en":"The photographer tried to recapture the atmosphere of her childhood village.","zh":"摄影师试图重现童年村庄的氛围。","note":"recapture · 重获， 收复 · recapture a feeling","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1171","en":"He likes to boast about the vegetables in his garden.","zh":"他喜欢夸耀自家花园里的蔬菜。","note":"boast · 自夸； 夸耀 · boast about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1172","en":"The centre offers a refresher course for returning language learners.","zh":"中心为重新开始语言学习的人提供复习课程。","note":"refresher · 提神物； 帮助记忆的东西或人； 补习课程 · a refresher course","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1173","en":"The organiser will reiterate the meeting arrangements before everyone leaves.","zh":"大家离开前，组织者会重申会议安排。","note":"reiterate · 重复， 反复； 反复地说， 重申 · reiterate a point","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1174","en":"The café furnished its reading corner with secondhand furniture.","zh":"咖啡馆用二手家具布置了阅读角。","note":"furniture · 家具 · wooden furniture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1175","en":"The librarian met her counterpart from a neighbouring university.","zh":"这位图书管理员与邻近大学担任同样职务的同行见了面。","note":"counterpart · 与对方地位相当的人； 配对物； 副本 · meet one's counterpart","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1176","en":"The dim lighting gave the empty theatre a sinister atmosphere.","zh":"昏暗的灯光给空荡荡的剧院增添了阴森的氛围。","note":"sinister · 不吉祥的， 凶兆的； 险恶的， 邪恶的 · a sinister atmosphere","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1177","en":"The documentary includes a short segment about traditional fishing boats.","zh":"纪录片包含了一小段关于传统渔船的内容。","note":"segment · 片段； 部分； 节； 线段； 瓣 · a short segment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1178","en":"A narrow blue stripe runs along the edge of the bowl.","zh":"碗的边缘环绕着一条细细的蓝色条纹。","note":"stripe · 条纹 · a narrow stripe","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1179","en":"Try to imagine how the square looked a century ago.","zh":"试着想象这个广场一个世纪前的样子。","note":"imagine · 想象； 猜想 · imagine a future","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1180","en":"The flexible timetable makes the course attractive to working adults.","zh":"灵活的课表使这门课对在职成年人很有吸引力。","note":"attractive · 吸引的， 有吸引力的； 引起注意的 · an attractive option","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1181","en":"The café can cater for small groups with advance notice.","zh":"如果提前通知，咖啡馆可以为小团体提供餐食。","note":"cater · 提供饮食； 迎合； 满足需要 · cater for groups","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1182","en":"The young orchestra gave a superb performance despite limited rehearsal time.","zh":"尽管排练时间有限，年轻的乐团仍带来了一场精彩演出。","note":"superb · 极好的； 高质量的 · a superb performance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1183","en":"Keep a duplicate copy of the completed registration form.","zh":"请留存一份填好的登记表副本。","note":"duplicate · 完全相同的；副本的；复制，复写；重复['djuːplɪkət]；复制品 · a duplicate copy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1184","en":"The report records a decrease in packaging waste this year.","zh":"报告记录了今年包装废弃物的减少。","note":"decrease · 减少，减小['dɪːkriːs]；减少； 减少量 · a steady decrease","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1185","en":"The book includes a glossary of unfamiliar botanical terms.","zh":"这本书附有一份生僻植物学术语的词汇表。","note":"glossary · 词汇表； 术语表 · a useful glossary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1186","en":"Paper flags began to flutter above the crowded market.","zh":"纸旗开始在拥挤的市场上方飘动。","note":"flutter · 振， 拍打； 飘动， 晃动； 跳动 · flutter in the breeze","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1187","en":"His mistakes revealed ignorance of the town's complex history.","zh":"他的错误表明他不了解这个镇复杂的历史。","note":"ignorance · 无知， 愚昧； 不知道 · ignorance of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-11:s1188","en":"The report explores housing problems afflicting the coastal community.","z